  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.85,
      "end": 9.38,
      "text": "We have now reached the final round of Pension Fursuit.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013214
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 9.38,
      "end": 14.62,
      "text": "The game where taxpayers, young and old, face off against their own state politicians and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013214
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 14.62,
      "end": 15.62,
      "text": "state employees.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013214
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 15.62,
      "end": 21.66,
      "text": "The question we're going to conclude with is how big are pension liabilities?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013214
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 21.66,
      "end": 27.18,
      "text": "To figure that out, we have to first know how much money is owed to state employees.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013214
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 27.18,
      "end": 34.82,
      "text": "In 2014, it was widely reported that state and local pension funds had $3.6 trillion in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 34.82,
      "end": 35.82,
      "text": "total assets.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 35.82,
      "end": 41.7,
      "text": "The question becomes, is this adequate to fund their pension obligations?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 41.7,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "And if not, by how much are pensions underfunded?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 46.1,
      "end": 51.46,
      "text": "Many researchers compile the self-reported disclosures of pension liabilities from state",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 51.46,
      "end": 53.02,
      "text": "and local governments.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.188235,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062805
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 53.02,
      "end": 60.46,
      "text": "Together, they total $4.8 trillion in future obligations to retirees, implying an unfunded",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 60.46,
      "end": 64.46,
      "text": "liability of $1.2 trillion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 68.58,
      "text": "But keep in mind that in their reporting, state and local governments are using overly",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 68.58,
      "end": 72.02,
      "text": "optimistic assumptions about annual rates of return.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 72.02,
      "end": 76.58,
      "text": "They're hoping risky investments pay off in a big way.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 76.58,
      "end": 82.42,
      "text": "As we've discussed, this is not the most appropriate way to report these pension obligations.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099011,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002251
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 82.42,
      "end": 87.02,
      "text": "Since these pension liabilities must be honored, they are essentially equivalent to default",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 87.02,
      "end": 88.86,
      "text": "free government debt.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 88.86,
      "end": 93.98,
      "text": "Consequently, they should be measured using the rate of return on risk-free bonds, such",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 93.98,
      "end": 95.9,
      "text": "as treasury bonds.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 95.9,
      "end": 101.54,
      "text": "A portfolio of treasury bonds that has the same average maturity or duration as pension",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 101.54,
      "end": 108.14,
      "text": "promises about 14 years has a rate of return of 2.8%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.191544,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006691
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 108.14,
      "end": 114.38,
      "text": "With this approach, Hoover Institution Research shows that the pension liabilities total $7",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 114.38,
      "end": 115.38,
      "text": "trillion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 115.38,
      "end": 123.62,
      "text": "So $3.6 trillion in assets minus $7 trillion in liabilities results in an unfunded total",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 123.62,
      "end": 131.5,
      "text": "liability of $3.4 trillion, which is almost three times higher than what's being reported.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 131.5,
      "end": 136.66,
      "text": "And with the relatively flat stock market of the past few years, the situation has surely",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 136.66,
      "end": 137.66,
      "text": "worsened.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.184375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.51123
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 138.02,
      "end": 144.94,
      "text": "Pension fund investment returns in 2015 and 2016 are likely far below the pipe dream return",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130812,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 144.94,
      "end": 148.14,
      "text": "rates assumed in 2014.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130812,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 148.14,
      "end": 153.5,
      "text": "If you believe the $3.6 trillion in assets are going to be managed well and generate",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130812,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 153.5,
      "end": 158.42,
      "text": "really high returns, you can hope that the profits from the risky investments will reduce",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130812,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 158.42,
      "end": 163.86,
      "text": "the overall unfunded liability of $3.4 trillion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130812,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 163.86,
      "end": 168.22,
      "text": "But there is no guarantee that this will happen, and stating the liability with a built-in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.156523,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033081
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 168.22,
      "end": 174.78,
      "text": "assumption of hoped-for risky returns is simply a poor measurement of a government promise.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.156523,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033081
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 174.78,
      "end": 178.42,
      "text": "So the key points to take away are 1.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.156523,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033081
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 178.42,
      "end": 183.62,
      "text": "Most media coverage of public pensions relies on flawed governmental accounting methods,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.156523,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033081
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 183.62,
      "end": 188.5,
      "text": "which are not consistent with well-established principles of financial economics.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.156523,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.033081
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 188.62,
      "end": 189.62,
      "text": "2.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 189.62,
      "end": 193.94,
      "text": "True liabilities are much higher than what the state reports reveal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 193.94,
      "end": 194.94,
      "text": "3.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 194.94,
      "end": 200.54,
      "text": "And this doesn't even include health care obligations, which are typically underfunded.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 200.54,
      "end": 206.02,
      "text": "Many entities don't set aside money, yet still promise health coverage for their retirees,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 206.02,
      "end": 210.74,
      "text": "covering the cost of care before they become eligible for Medicare, and paying for coverage",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 210.74,
      "end": 213.3,
      "text": "gaps once they're on Medicare.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 213.3,
      "end": 218.1,
      "text": "In most cases, they are not setting aside funds for this health coverage.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.159171,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015419
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 218.1,
      "end": 219.1,
      "text": "The bottom line?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 219.1,
      "end": 224.02,
      "text": "You might have thought state and local governments were running balanced budgets, but they are",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 224.02,
      "end": 225.02,
      "text": "not.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 225.02,
      "end": 230.22,
      "text": "They're making enormous future commitments to hard-working state employees, without",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 230.22,
      "end": 232.82,
      "text": "making proper provisions to honor them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 232.82,
      "end": 236.22,
      "text": "They're borrowing from tomorrow to pay for today.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 236.22,
      "end": 240.82,
      "text": "Future generations will have to pay more in taxes than they will receive in services.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 240.82,
      "end": 242.78,
      "text": "Does that sound fair?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 242.78,
      "end": 246.7,
      "text": "A growing part of your city's expenditures is on pensions.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.173189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 246.7,
      "end": 251.38,
      "text": "More and more of it is money that should have been contributed in the past, and as cities",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127497,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.522949
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 251.38,
      "end": 257.1,
      "text": "and states get further and further behind, it's only going to get worse.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127497,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.522949
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 257.1,
      "end": 262.02,
      "text": "Visit pensionpursuit.com to learn more and see what you can do to help.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127497,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.522949
    }
